# The champion with the rebuild gate at 5,000: a razed extractor pool is
# re-claimed only once the strongest rival's army value sits 5,000 below
# its recent peak, so the builder's walk back rides a broken wave instead
# of dying to the standing one ([[impossible-economy-problem]] class 1,
# invented for Impossible and never priced at Very Hard). Motivated by
# the pinbase48 anatomy (log 2026-09-12): every pinned VH loss is income-
# halved by the 25 percent mark and never re-expands -- x1-2 extractors
# for the whole back half while the enemy compounds. Every other knob is
# the champion's, so a paired diff prices the gate alone.
name evolve1-g4m2-rb5k
goals extractorT1,extractorT1,extractorT1,c_tank,c_tank,c_tank,heavyTank,hoverTank
heavies heavyTank,heavyTank
max_workers 8
mass 25
